{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"b300d2a00ef4238c256f8a9d29bc0a1d295803bb4dc8e9a92c0dd26615335564","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以西结蒙召"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那声音对我说：“人子啊，你站起来，我要对你说话。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["正说的时候，耶和华的灵就进入我里面，使我站起来。我听见那声音对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["“人子啊，我派你去那背叛我的国民以色列人那里。他们和他们的祖先至今仍背叛我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我派你到那些心里刚硬的人那里，向他们宣告，‘主耶和华这样说。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["不管那群叛逆的人听不听，他们都会知道有一位先知在他们当中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["人子啊，不要怕他们和他们的话，虽然你周围布满荆棘和毒蝎，也不要害怕。他们是一群叛逆的人，你不要怕他们的话，也不要因为他们的脸色而惊慌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他们是叛逆的，不论他们听不听，你都要把我的话告诉他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["“人子啊，你要听我对你说的话，不要像他们那样叛逆，要张开口吃我赐给你的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["这时我观看，见一只手向我伸来，手中拿着书卷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["那只手把那书卷在我面前打开，书卷的两面都写满了哀伤、叹息和悲痛的话。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}